# Deployment Readiness

## Objective

Code that works locally must also be **deployable, configurable, and recoverable** in target environments.

## Requirements

- Follow project build/release pipeline; document new steps in `/docs` when non-obvious.
- Config and secrets separated from artifacts.
- Migrations or schema changes versioned and reversible when applicable (`migration-safety.mdc`).
- Consider rollback: can this change be undone safely?
- Smoke-test or verify after deploy when the user requests build/deploy.
> **If this project has no web/deployment surface:** apply the same principles to the nearest release artifact (binary, package, plugin, mobile build) or skip.

## Cross-links

`configuration.mdc`, `testing.mdc`, `release-management.mdc`.

## Golden Rule

Undeployable code is unfinished code.